"This list is based on the current search, not limited by the selected "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj se popis temelji na trenutačnoj pretrazi i nije ograničen odabranom "
"domnom."

msgid "Export/Copy"
msgstr "Izvoz / kopiranje"

